Word lists in this directory are derived from the 2018 OpenSubtitles frequency
lists published by Hermit Dave:

https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords

The word-list content is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike
4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0).

Changes: limited to about 12,000 words per language, filtered to alphabetic
tokens, and split so a word that is much more common in English than in
Swedish (or the reverse) is kept for that language only.
